{%- interactionwrite channeltypemediumvalueid:'45691' channelname:'Subsplash App' componententitytypeid:'31' componentname:'TV App Home Announcements' componententityid:'31221' operation:'View' summary:'TV App Home Announcements Page' personaliasid:'{{ CurrentPerson.PrimaryAliasId }}' -%}TV App Home Announcements Page{%- endinteractionwrite -%}
{%- contentchannelitem where:'Guid == "{{Guid}}"' -%}
{%- assign item = contentchannelitemItems | First -%}
{%- assign subtitleSize = item | Attribute:'Subtitle' | Size -%}
{%- assign mediaElementShortCode = item | Attribute:'SubsplashVideo','SourceKey' -%}
{%- assign mediaElement = item | Attribute:'SubsplashVideo','FileDataJson'  -%}
{%- endcontentchannelitem -%}
{
	"header": {
		"title": "{{- item.Title -}}{% if subtitleSize > 0 %}: {{ item | Attribute:'Subtitle' }}{% endif %}"
	},
	{%- if mediaElementShortCode != empty and mediaElementShortCode != '' -%}
		"sapid":"{{ mediaElementShortCode }}",
	{%- else -%}
		"sapid":"0000000",
	{%- endif -%}
	"images": [{ "width":1080, "url":"{{ 'Global' | Attribute:'MobileApplicationRoot'}}GetImage.ashx/{{item | Attribute:'Image','RawValue'}}.jpg?guid={{item | Attribute:'Image','RawValue'}}&width=720"}],
	"media": [
		{%- if mediaElement != empty and mediaElement != '' -%}
			{
				"url":"{{ mediaElement| FromJSON | Where:'Format', 'application/x-mpegURL' | Select:'Link' }}",
				"format":"m3u8",
				"downloadable":false,
				"sapid":"{{ mediaElementShortCode }}"
			},
			{
				"url":"{{ mediaElement | FromJSON | Where:'Format', 'video/mp4' | Select:'Link' }}",
				"format":"mp4",
				"sapid":"{{ mediaElementShortCode }}"
			}
		{%- else -%}
			{
				{%- assign videoUrl = item | Attribute:'VideoURL','RawValue' -%}
				{%-comment-%}
				{%- if videoUrl contains 'm3u8' -%}
					{%- capture videoUrl -%}{{ 'Global' | Attribute:'MobileApplicationRoot'}}webhooks/lava.ashx/streaming/{{item.Guid}}.m3u8{% endcapture %}
				{%- endif -%}
				{%-endcomment-%}
					"url":"{{videoUrl}}",
					"format":"{{- item | Attribute:'VideoType' -}}",
					"sapid":"0000000"
			}
		{%- endif -%}
        ],
	"title": "{{- item.Title | Replace:'"','\"'  -}}{% if subtitleSize > 0 %}: {{ item | Attribute:'Subtitle' | Replace:'"','\"'  }}{% endif %}",
	"body":"{{ item.Content  | Replace:'"','\"' | UrlEncode | Replace:'%0A','' | UrlDecode | StripHtml }}"
}
